			"text":"1. Need to drain [[029 - The Pool.canvas|029 - The Pool]] or have a [[Tomb.canvas|Tomb]] to access the [[Reservoir.canvas|Reservoir]] Boat\n2. Then need to set the Reservoir Level at 13.\n3. Cross the Reservoir with the Boat\n4. Drain the Reservoir to 6\n5. Use the Boat to reach the [[Safehouse Station.canvas|Safehouse Station]]\n",
